<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG NEW YORK BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    24.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    24.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p>		GLOBAL PUBLIC SECTOR PFANDBRIEF ISSUED UNDER SECTION</p>
